SkillDesc: {
	FlightSkill:
		'''
		While riding the broom, increases flight speed by {0:0.##}% and enables the Broom Acceleration key:
		Hold it to boost to {1:0.##}x speed, costing {2:0.##} [klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/Snippets/MagicStarIcon][c/4C91FFFF:Magic Power] per second.
		Tap it to dash in your movement direction, costing {3:0.##} [klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/Snippets/MagicStarIcon][c/4C91FFFF:Magic Power] with a {4:0.##}-second cooldown.
		'''
	HealSkill: Restores {0} life to you or one nearby teammate over {2} seconds. Healing stacks.
	AlchemySkill:
		'''
		Elaina can craft all kinds of items through alchemy. Right-click a cauldron to browse recipes and start crafting.
		Raising your alchemy level unlocks more items to craft.
		'''
	FrostVeilSkill:
		'''
		Grants you and nearby teammates 3 frost shields each. Each hit consumes one shield to block {1:0.##} damage (5% of maximum [klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/Snippets/MagicStarIcon][c/4C91FFFF:Magic Power]).
		Shields last 60 seconds. If any remain at expiry, they refill for free and renew; once all are consumed, cast again.
		'''
	DollControlSkill:
		'''
		Consumes 20 [klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/Snippets/MagicStarIcon][c/4C91FFFF:Magic Power] to summon {0} dolls that stay until dismissed. Their work actions are {1}% faster.
		While it is out, hold left-click to open the command wheel: Mine Blocks and Break Walls let you select areas, and their chain versions select connected matches with a click. Select again to erase. Click Start Mining or Start Breaking to submit; Exit discards this selection without affecting existing tasks.
		The dolls claim separate targets to mine blocks, break walls or place planters together. They use the best pickaxe or hammer in your inventory, then return to hand over their collected items when the work is done. Cancel Tasks clears all marks; Dismiss Dolls recalls the whole team.
		With at least one idle doll, right-click a distant chest on screen to send it over. It interacts after arriving and completing its opening gesture, using the chest's usual keys and conditions. It waits beside the open chest and returns when you close it. Ordinary nearby opening is unchanged.
		'''
	RecallSkill:
		'''
		Summons a magic circle beneath you or a nearby ally. After 1.5 seconds, all allies standing on it travel to the chosen ally's spawn point.
		Both circles remain for 30 seconds, allowing unlimited travel between them. Recasting closes your previous pair.
		'''
	ShardbindSkill:
		'''
		Summons 15 ice shards that hunt down an enemy near the cursor, each dealing a small area hit, then unleashes a large ice burst for {0} Ice damage in total.
		Binds the target in ice for the duration, leaving it unable to act.
		Starts sealed. Triggering [klicon/16,0:KL/Drawing/Snippets/Icons/IceIcon][c/8FE3FFFF:Freeze] unseals one use, which cannot stack. Casting still requires the cooldown to finish and seals the spell again. Unsealing does not reduce its cooldown.
		'''
	IceConeSkill:
		'''
		Fires three ice cones, each dealing {0} Ice damage and adding {1:0.###} [klicon/16,0:KL/Drawing/Snippets/Icons/IceIcon][c/8FE3FFFF:Freeze] buildup.
		Triggering [klicon/16,0:KL/Drawing/Snippets/Icons/IceIcon][c/8FE3FFFF:Freeze] yourself unseals one use of {2}.
		'''
	WaterBallSkill:
		'''
		Hold to conjure a water orb, then release to launch it, dealing {0} damage.
		After traveling a certain distance, the orb bursts in a wide splash behind the target along its flight direction. At close range, it bursts in a circular splash instead.
		On hit, reduces the target's [klicon/16,0:KL/Drawing/Snippets/Icons/IceIcon][c/8FE3FFFF:Freeze] cooldown by 10 seconds and {1}'s cooldown by 8 seconds.
		'''
	WaterLaserSKill:
		'''
		Hold to channel a water beam. Every {0} seconds, consumes {3} Magic Power and deals {1} Water damage, splashing enemies near the end of the beam for {2}%.
		Deals only {4:0.#}% damage to targets not on [klicon/16,0:KL/Drawing/Snippets/Icons/IceIcon][c/8FE3FFFF:Freeze] cooldown.
		On hit, reduces the target's [klicon/16,0:KL/Drawing/Snippets/Icons/IceIcon][c/8FE3FFFF:Freeze] cooldown by 0.5 seconds and {5}'s cooldown by 0.3 seconds.
		'''
	MagicMissileSkill:
		'''
		Deals {0} magic damage to the target.
		Passive: Magic Missile ignores enemy defense. After hitting the same target 5 times consecutively, it deals splash damage equal to 200% of Magic Missile's damage to other nearby enemies (the main target is not affected).
		'''
	MultiMissileSkill:
		'''
		Summons a floating magic orb that follows you, up to {0} at a time.
		Each orb fires a Magic Missile at the nearest enemy, dealing {1} magic damage.
		'''
	AshenWitchSkill:
		'''
		Elaina uses [klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/Snippets/MagicStarIcon][c/4C91FFFF:Magic Power] to cast skills. Each point of vanilla maximum mana gained increases her maximum [klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/Snippets/MagicStarIcon][c/4C91FFFF:Magic Power] by 1. Her bonus life is reduced by 50%. Each point of maximum life lost to Ashen Witch increases her maximum [klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/Snippets/MagicStarIcon][c/4C91FFFF:Magic Power] by 1.

		When [klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/Snippets/MagicStarIcon][c/4C91FFFF:Magic Power] is insufficient, she can spend 1% of her maximum life to restore 1% of her maximum [klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/Snippets/MagicStarIcon][c/4C91FFFF:Magic Power] for casting. This is unavailable while her current life is below 10% of her maximum life.
		'''
	MagicBarrierSkill:
		'''
		Requires the Ashen Witch skill to be enabled.
		Activate the barrier just before taking damage. It reduces damage based on the life lost to Ashen Witch and consumes [klicon/16,0:伊蕾娜/Snippets/MagicStarIcon][c/4C91FFFF:Magic Power] equal to the damage blocked by the barrier.
		When affected by certain damage-over-time effects, the barrier also stays deployed, granting complete immunity to those effects.
		'''
	WindSlashSkill:
		'''
		Unleashes a piercing wind blade that deals {0} magic damage to every enemy in its path.
		Weaker enemies are knocked back along the blade's direction.
		'''
}

